= Orlando I Government Collapses!

The Orlando I Government comprising of the UL, PSRI, LDR, DS, and PPI has fallen, primarily due to Orlando's failure to secure the territories of Fiume, among others, during the Paris Peace Conference. 

The President of the United States, Woodrow Wilson, denied <span style="color: #008C45;">**It**</span><span style="color: #E5E4E2;">**a**</span><span style="color: #CD212A;">**ly**</span> most of its territorial gains, mostly due to his published "Fourteen Points", leading the <span style="color: #008C45;">**It**</span><span style="color: #E5E4E2;">**ali**</span><span style="color: #CD212A;">**an**</span> delegation to walkout in April, causing a debacle back in <span style="color: #008C45;">**It**</span><span style="color: #E5E4E2;">**a**</span><span style="color: #CD212A;">**ly**</span>, with this only further advancing the <span style="color: [+ pnf_colour +];">nationalist</span> narrative of the "Mutilated Victory" and upsetting the people too.

Disgraced, Orlando has chosen to resign, and Francesco Saverio Nitti has taken over the Prime Ministership.

